      "seed": 955176334,
      "version": 1939,
      "versionNonce": 376881742,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791247434753,
      "created": 1791247336801,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Get Work searches in files_meta and collect from a file\nsome amount of bytes or all.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Get Work searches in files_meta and collect from a file\nsome amount of bytes or all.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4qqTr8jtfnCe_QgK9VopJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 483.7131342434118,
      "y": 2483.8926019947276,
      "width": 707.1795654296875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e8590c",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aDql",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1224462162,
      "version": 2082,
      "versionNonce": 789039822,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791247465271,
      "created": 1791247435021,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In the following cases, the requested amount is < the size of most files",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In the following cases, the requested amount is < the size of most files",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tXw7eZeCNCFv5ucErbWZe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2297.2819993122316,
      "y": 1241.7190690969182,
      "width": 536.8596801757812,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e8590c",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aDr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1654071182,
      "version": 948,
      "versionNonce": 1555423822,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791239911276,
      "created": 1791200974363,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Take max_buf.\n2. Initialize current_buf.\n2. Loop over the input file paths, and open each one.\n3. If the content of the file + current_buf > max_buf:\n        input is ready\n        otherwise continue\n4. Assign each n_procs thread a portion of the work:\n        max_buf / n_threads\n\n5. Wait until there's a result  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Take max_buf.\n2. Initialize current_buf.\n2. Loop over the input file paths, and open each one.\n3. If the content of the file + current_buf > max_buf:\n        input is ready\n        otherwise continue\n4. Assign each n_procs thread a portion of the work:\n        max_buf / n_threads\n\n5. Wait until there's a result  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fGvC4FZwVN9nwgw514eyO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1237.9392500830365,
      "y": 1238.5868976318047,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e8590c",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aDt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1588820903,
      "version": 1258,
      "versionNonce": 1398418279,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791160126369,
      "created": 1791159587962,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Master thread opens all file or until max open (configurable, e.g 1GB is\nreached).\n\n2. Master thread spins up the worker threads according to the number of procs \navailable.\n\n3. Each thread wait for work to be assigned to it.\n\n4. Master thread loops and repeatedly request get_work, and push work to each\nthread round robin.\n\n5. Worker thread takes the work and compress the content from buffer, and\nwrite to a buffer.\n\n6.After each pass, master thread waits for a condition variable that signals that\nthere's a work done, if so it copies to the final destination file, otherwise waits.\n\n(Main thread only sleeps (wait on condition variable when theres no result at\nall)). ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Master thread opens all file or until max open (configurable, e.g 1GB is reached).\n\n2. Master thread spins up the worker threads according to the number of procs \navailable.\n\n3. Each thread wait for work to be assigned to it.\n\n4. Master thread loops and repeatedly request get_work, and push work to each thread round robin.\n\n5. Worker thread takes the work and compress the content from buffer, and write to a buffer.\n\n6.After each pass, master thread waits for a condition variable that signals that there's a work done, if so it copies to the final destination file, otherwise waits.\n\n(Main thread only sleeps (wait on condition variable when theres no result at all)). ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
