      "updated": 1791241796255,
      "created": 1791241541414,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This approach makes it easy to find the appropriate location to write each slot to, simply loop\nthrough the slot sequentially and write them one by one.\n\nOnce all the slots are empty, only then we can start the next batch (get works, assign to all worker,\nand wait again). ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This approach makes it easy to find the appropriate location to write each slot to, simply loop through the slot sequentially and write them one by one.\n\nOnce all the slots are empty, only then we can start the next batch (get works, assign to all worker, and wait again). ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
